{c: Verse 1}
[F]Javani [C]yan ye mast mast bin [F]piye,        [F]Jalati [C]chal rahi hai raah me [F]diye
[F]Na jane iname kisake vaste hun mai,        [F]Na jane [C]iname kaun hai mere [F]liye
[F]Mere liye mere liye, mere liye mere liye,        Sabhi [A#]hasi sabhi [F]java,
Kahan pe [A#]dil ko haa [F]riye,        [F]Sabhi hai dil ke mehama
[F]Kise kise pukaariye, kise kise pukaariye,        [F]Javani [C]yan ye mast mast bin [F]piye
[F]Jalati [C]chal rahi hai raah me [F]diye,        [F]Na jane iname kisake vaste hun mai
[F]Na jane [C]iname kaun hai mere [F]liye,        [F]Mere liye mere liye, mere liye mere liye
Divaane [A#]ham the chaah [F]ke,        To be [A#]qarar ho [F]liye
[F]Ke dur ki nigaah ke,        [G]Gunahagar ho liye, gunahagar ho liye
